model/, pipeline/, trainer/  --  Self-Forcing and Causal Forcing
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The training and inference scaffolding under `model/`, `pipeline/` and `trainer/`
is derived from Self-Forcing (https://github.com/guandeh17/Self-Forcing) and
Causal Forcing (https://github.com/thu-ml/Causal-Forcing), both Apache-2.0, which
